    "turn_text": "Well, I think we are, by the way. There's an awful lot going on. Now, for example, they're at MD Anderson at over in Baltimore at, I'm trying to think of the other major, I think it's the hutch. I know Hopkins, but I said, but I'm thinking of the hutch out in Washington State. They are working. We're going to give Kim Davis a shout out too for",
