      {
        "text": "The new system reduces approval time for dual-drug therapy trials from one to one and a half years to three months.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Federal agencies like CMS and NIH can become more engaged and responsive to accelerate progress in cancer research.",
        "confidence": 0.9
